- Congratulations! You have reached room 7!!

## Section: System Mastery

To pass this room:
---------------------------------------------------------------------

- Seven locked gates block your path. Each gate is a file with
  WRONG permissions. Fix them all to proceed!

## The gates and their REQUIRED permissions:

  | File     | Required Permission | Numeric |
  |----------|-------------------- |---------|
  | gate_1   | rwxr-xr-x           | 755     |
  | gate_2   | rw-r--r--           | 644     |
  | gate_3   | rwx------           | 700     |
  | gate_4   | r--r--r--           | 444     |
  | gate_5   | rwxrwxr-x           | 775     |
  | gate_6   | rw-rw----           | 660     |
  | gate_7   | r-x--x--x           | 511     |

## Tasks:

1. Check current permissions: `ls -l gate_*`
2. Fix each gate's permissions using `chmod`.
   >> hint: `chmod 755 gate_1` or `chmod u=rwx,g=rx,o=rx gate_1`
3. Once ALL gates have the correct permissions, run `./getKey.sh`
   >> The script will verify all permissions and give you the password.

>> To move to the next room: next PASSWORD

Good Luck !!!
